    "adaptations": "Foundation: catch–throw, soft ball, low net. Intermediate: continuous contact. Advanced: small target or short time. Large group: six courts. Small: 2v2. Limited space: short court. Partial equipment: one ball per triad and rope. Varied needs: visual cue, strong markings, extra time, fixed partner.",
    "assessment": "Checks: recovery to base, movement to the ball, coverage of open space, triangle shape, communication. Success: 4–5 criteria. Partial: 2–3 with prompt. Not yet: 0–1 or unsafe; return to soft-ball catch–throw.",
